# ZAHO Design System — Color Rule

All UI (site vitrine, dashboard, future modules) **must** use tokens from `docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`. Do not introduce new accent colors.

## Required CSS variables

```css
:root {
  --pine: #14261C;
  --pine-mid: #2C4229;
  --gold: #C7A24A;
  --gold-soft: #E4C878;
  --cream: #F4EFE1;
  --ink: #1E1B12;
  --line: #DCD3B8;
}
```

## Semantic usage

| Purpose | Token |
|---------|-------|
| Page background | `--cream` |
| Dark surfaces (topbar, hero) | `--pine` |
| Body text on light bg | `--ink` |
| Text on dark bg | `--cream` |
| Primary accent / CTAs | `--gold` → hover `--gold-soft` |
| Borders & dividers | `--line` |
| Muted labels | `#6B6650` |
| Active nav item bg | `#EAE3CE` (`--slot-bg`) |
| Focus ring | `--gold-soft` |

## Typography

- **Display / headings:** `'Fraunces', serif`
- **UI / body:** `'Work Sans', sans-serif`
- **Font sizes & spacing:** rem only — `--text-*` and `--space-*` from `Styles/Shared/_tokens.css`; px only for borders, shadows, radius, fixed shell (see `.cursor/rules/css-typography-rem.mdc`)

## Do not

- Use generic blues, grays, or Bootstrap defaults for buttons/borders
- Hardcode `#007bff`, `#E5E7EB`, or navy without mapping to ZAHO tokens
- Add new brand colors without updating `docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md` first
- Use rounded corners (8px+) on dashboard buttons, tables, or panels — keep edges **sharp** (`border-radius: 0`), matching the vitrine CTAs

